  "assessment": "Widespread discontent across all segments of our society, particularly among urban youth and workers, threatens stability despite high repression. To appease the populace and our military and security services, we must reallocate resources toward welfare and security while strengthening regional economic ties. Accepting trade agreements with African partners will foster external goodwill and support our economic base.",
