  "public_statement": "The Kingdom of Eswatini remains steadfast in its commitment to the welfare and prosperity of all emaSwati. By expanding our trade partnerships across the African continent and reinforcing our social and security frameworks, we lay the groundwork for a stable, resilient nation under the guidance of our Crown.",
